sblock 35 live text paragraph left 635 TeX%20carries%20every%20length%20as%20an%20integer%20number%20of%20scaled%20points,%20one%20sixty-five-thousand-five-hundred-and-thirty-sixth%20of%20a%20point,%20and%20rounds%20exactly%20once%20%E2%80%94%20at%20ship-out,%20on%20a%20final%20absolute%20coordinate.%20The%20glue%20renderer%20keeps%20a%20running%20total%20of%20the%20stretch%20it%20has%20handed%20out,%20multiplies%20the%20whole%20total%20by%20the%20box's%20ratio,%20rounds%20that,%20and%20takes%20a%20difference%20against%20the%20previous%20rounded%20total.%20Round%20each%20space%20independently%20instead%20and%20the%20error%20walks%20along%20the%20line,%20so%20the%20last%20word%20misses%20the%20right%20margin%20by%20a%20point%20or%20two.%20It%20looks%20like%20a%20bug%20in%20the%20breaker,%20and%20it%20is%20a%20bug%20in%20the%20arithmetic.
